[12117]="700077E0\n1\tLleva la mochila a Lolo Wendingway\030Recupera la mochila de Lolo Wendingway del oso que la robó\tLolo Wendingway está en el camino entre Combe y Entibo. El oso que se llevó la mochila de Lolo Wendingway la arrastró hasta el valle al este de él. Debes devolverle la mochila en quince minutos; de lo contrario, perderá los buenos precios de la hierba para pipa en Entibo.\n",
[12118]="700413CF\n1\tQuestion a patron\tEthring tavern is located in Ringló Vale. You should question a patron of the tavern.\n2\tQuestion the barkeep\tEthring tavern is located in Ringló Vale. You should question the barkeep.\n3\tSpeak with Jajax\tEthring tavern is located in Ringló Vale. You should speak with Jajax.\n4\tHave a drink with Jajax\tEthring tavern is located in Ringló Vale. Have a drink with Jajax.\n5\tQuestion Jajax\tEthring tavern is located in Ringló Vale. You should question Jajax.\n6\tSpeak with Laerind\tLaerind is located in Ethring village. You should speak with Laerind.\n7\tQuestion Jajax again\tEthring tavern is located in Ringló Vale. You should question Jajax again.\n",
[12119]="7006000F\n1\tTravel to Crágan Bris\tCrágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach. You should travel to Crágan Bris.\n2\tTalk to Skálgrund, the Exile at Crágan Bris\tCrágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach. You should talk to Skálgrund at Crágan Bris.\n3\tAdd the feed to the feed buckets (cantidad: según el diario)\tCrágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach. You should feed the rams at Crágan Bris.\n4\tTalk to Skálgrund at Crágan Bris\tCrágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach. You should talk to Skálgrund at Crágan Bris.\n5\tReturn to Mézto with what you have learned\tMézto and be found at Grúmachath in central Câr Bronach. You should return to Mézto.\n",
[12120]="7005A64F\n1\tCollect the supplies next to Prince Ingór\tMaergrind, the Noble Gate of Máttugard, can be found in Gundabad. You should collect the supplies next to Prince Ingór.\n2\tMaergrind, the Noble Gate of Máttugard, can be found in Gundabad. You should deliver expedition supplies to those at Maergrind.\t\n3\tCompletado\tYou delivered supplies for the expedition to those who needed them.\n",
[12121]="70008B86\n1\tHabla con Elrond en Rivendel\tElrond está en su biblioteca en Rivendel. Sigrun te ha pedido que regreses ante Elrond con noticias sobre la magnitud de la amenaza que ahora acecha dentro de Helegrod.\n",
[12122]="70046C2B\n1\tCollect lush horsetail (total: 3)\030Collect lush oxlip (total: 3)\030Collect lush vetchling (total: 3)\tLush oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling can be found nearby Ereblen in north-western Ithilien. Ereblen has asked you to gather lush oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling, so that you might learn more of their uses.\n2\tDeliver the bundles of horsetail, oxlip, and vetchling to Ereblen\tEreblen can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn. You have harvested many of Ithilien's flowers and herbs, and you should now return to Ereblen.\n",
[12123]="700479DF\n1\tEnter the enemy encampment of Dûm Boha\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should defeat Haradrim look-outs and half-troll executioners.\n2\tDefeat Haradrim look-outs (total: 5)\030Defeat half-troll executioners (total: 6)\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should defeat Haradrim look-outs and half-troll executioners.\n3\tCompletado\tDefeated many Haradrim look-outs and half-troll executioners.\n",
[12124]="70058B88\n1\tDefeat Gundabad war-trolls at Azgh-buzru (total: 8)\tGundabad war-trolls can be found at Azgh-buzru. Náin has asked you to defeat roaming war-trolls of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru.\n2\tTalk to Náin at Drenghól\tNáin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks. You have defeated many of the roaming war-trolls of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru. You should return to Náin.\n",
[12125]="700682A3\n1\tSearch for the rumoured treasure in Bax Garâkh\tKotheret Glint-grin told you about the rumoured treasure. Whether the treasure is real, she cannot say. It may have been buried somewhere in Bax Garâkh, east of Mâr Naphra.\n2\tDig into the sand mound\tYou have discovered the possible location of the treasure cache. You should dig into the sand mound.\n3\tTry to open the treasure chest\tYou've discovered what appears to be the treasure Kotheret told you about. You should try to open it.\n4\tOpen the treasure chest\tTrying to open the treasure chest caused an angry shade to attack you. Now that you've vanquished it, you should try to open the chest again.\n5\tFind Kotheret Glint-grin in Mâr Naphra\tThe contents of the treasure were more troubling than valuable: an intact skull, and a metallic tooth like Kotheret's. You should return to her in Mâr Naphra and seek answers.\n6\tCompletado\tKotheret Glint-grin seems to have vanished from Mâr Naphra.\n",
[12126]="70071754\n1\tEncuentra Laivárth\tSamítai has told you how to reach Laivárth in Adagím to the north-east. You are to speak with Tálbiral when you arrive at the grove.\n2\tSpeak with Tálbiral\tYou have found Laivárth in Adagím. Find and speak to Tálbiral and let him know that Samítai sent you.\n",
[12127]="7006B708\n1\tComplete Instance: The Fading of the Forests\tAgalûnu has asked you to take her to meet the warden of Arwáth. You should tell her when you are ready to go.\n2\tTalk to Agalûnu\tYou escorted Agalûnu to meet with Shanthar. He explained why she should not clear-cut trees, especially in Ambarûl. You should talk to Agalûnu and find out what she is thinking.\n",
[12128]="7001AD1A\n1\tHabla con Bob en el campamento de refugiados entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte\tEncuentra el campamento de los supervivientes entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte\n",
